{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10004_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0ff21e1dfdf4602f8ec8b196a0db310b3300e9af18ee7ab9daf06aa74abacaa6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ed5505e1dcc9d716244727a49b01c30ef95b133ad88aff80ae06c716d45c2a",
      "text": "Legenders的约会企划",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa30d9a41e3f6199f195a70bce7d7279d65b8725fafb0a5668cc5092d5765278",
      "text": "Legenders被选为大型商业设施的宣传偶像。\n他们确定出演CM、歌曲合作绑定，\n并在设施内限期公开约会风格的视频，\n于是全员开始讨论起约会情境。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ed5505e1dcc9d716244727a49b01c30ef95b133ad88aff80ae06c716d45c2a",
      "text": "Legenders的约会企划",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b61cc3b1f77a56b9822df8387bdd1eed6ea95cf2a05bd1f4c9017629bdd577b",
      "text": "购物中心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59b738e3225ed86f24c75edadd7bf4474732731528801ff2e44f69a2f94f137e",
      "text": "前几天被带领着参观时我也感受到了，\n这里就像是吸引各类鱼群聚集的人工鱼礁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2485172367560117fad756f5b6cb46632b233a5c1b074450b19f15548bc14b62",
      "text": "踏入此地时，心随景动意飞扬……\n让人忍不住想去各个地方转转呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99c925e5cf96e22b9a0bd72e8564d06e7915b9f204e5f6bf7aa9d69e6e57a957",
      "text": "有各种各样的店铺和区域，\n感觉待上一整天都可以呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4916c2542987a85b14a05a648c806cd307547af3b3eab9382b792d60a7603913",
      "text": "是啊。而且以这么大的人流量来说，这里算挺干净的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fef8101dcd1b88caf1cf5fa16ad45e1f731c3c79c15a5912d4d18c6d36563e6",
      "text": "这样的大型商业设施的宣传工作，\n竟然会由我们Legenders来负责……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95c05131d1d97bc343ec56ec1d84f7a3ca5b45cd99c2504a58727ac880f6a395",
      "text": "还有CM歌曲的合作绑定，\n再次切身体会到这是一份重大的工作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5dd893b7b605a4a85ec2af9074178d126218d0229254cbb72e27c2893d8bebf",
      "text": "是的，深感光荣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857441104eb0d2c8d797a8df39ec618ad2744703f53ba770000afedfe8fa5360",
      "text": "“希望这个冬天，\n各个年龄层的人都能来本设施约会”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f59a499b8a4e90bf0eae1ab5115332fc1352e59e43b676cd772902c05685b41f",
      "text": "为了实现负责人所说的这个愿望，\n这次的航行，也请务必让它取得成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03157a44151d74c8233466d041382aeacbaf42a1caa3ae734c7826a347e277d2",
      "text": "嗯，那是当然的啦～。我们也很想\n让Legenders变得更加出名嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b7d83c1a076c5240262efe81eb1984a009361d3880fd2bc615ef69bcaaefd6",
      "text": "你们两个都干劲十足啊。\n既然这样，就赶紧开始准备拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0169f20511e1381642490555b76d86b457e9c491c537e556f8a92875ee982dc2",
      "text": "和我们的“约会风格视频”？\n嘿，要用那个来宣传商业设施吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1fc705cb7ad35552782e1b1ef5d11855d324fead25c96a2123496261ea7bf1c",
      "text": "是的。据说会在官方网站上进行限期发布。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab619d0ff1b83303b5fff1f3a32e322e0b36d79247adec12e9c450cd702cb05f",
      "text": "会为各位分配商业设施内的各个区域，\n并在那里进行视频拍摄，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dca10c9956b9bc825d47f543cba9a01ea87b12130e47b4f153edd1803218a56",
      "text": "负责人那边也发来了“希望各位能构思约会内容”\n的请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb4c771c22f63f585c4d10876cc18a5b4573baee4c2a43f328f9d38e776b4d9",
      "text": "既然这样，是不是也得设定恋爱对象啊～？\n毕竟约会的内容会因人而异嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d0a93860fbbada63a382700986b46cf3feb5118126277f8dba39a3931bbb3d",
      "text": "而且，从这次工作的角度来看，符合我们各自\n年龄的对象应该比较好吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eb30ce7920579e6838ca704e635b4ca947143d4898b4db050d485846df0bd31",
      "text": "现役大学生的北村的话，\n恋人大概就是大学同班同学的感觉？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a112049352b6542141ae6977dc7fab2f17457fc71e0f314ef5226215377c5061",
      "text": "啊，那个好像挺不错的～\n感觉能拍出很有真实感的视频呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2e4969b46e62435070394b1458a37a3b972e648b74fd0b93b9db80810e3c8f",
      "text": "克里斯先生的恋人嘛，让我想想～……\n暗暗在意的职场同事之类的～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8a10858fff50fc5210869002aaf6420702d2832552fb8a8e5d69f4f16de8f7e",
      "text": "这样啊……虽然是个很难的主题，\n但试着从同行这个关键词出发来思考看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_b:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b14a5abe7156bdda15dc0fb53ee4984b0cf5ce4ea607c6617472f19db7149fb",
      "text": "不过，“社会人情侣”这个主题，\n比起我来感觉更适合雨彦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cb00cfe0050725206bfc347d9f04cb03951cfa8eb6c2d8f9d144df468a021d3",
      "text": "适合我？社会人这个主题很适合我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4ae7f03121d391b60e423ef23f431037c3efb5e9bbc9ae43532efbac6e63238",
      "text": "是的。因为雨彦比我通晓世故得多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1320bd9c70622e6e591067147b0cd8f96092df58ad793db19d9e42b5d7fd2370",
      "text": "我觉得你应该能用温柔的言语与举止，\n包容恋人因工作而疲惫的心灵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6da2aa828c82c9be00f770a3ddd71296c02e1e2bc2f67bbe66f76dd718ea0333",
      "text": "哎呀。要是这么说的话，我也觉得，\n雨彦先生应该能做得到呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78a16d4d7cdd8ed3b8babbe8021ec72ff5b2a0a0ccafa306326a16fd981d715c",
      "text": "不过，稍微有点意外呢～\n克里斯先生居然会提出这样的点子～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:791b1bc75267cc342b41aad1685161a9be6b93358167795c45e5d0e5af4f5b2f",
      "text": "因为母亲和妹妹曾经说过，那样的男性非常有魅力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b3bbedf48971d067817c07fa59dd62a08312d6e2e40481e7c5412c5e09d58e8",
      "text": "我大概很难做到，\n但如果是雨彦的话应该可以，我是这么认为的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b47bfb33584f3e9f9891f56d088a7a2e9120a26b63ed85bfd7663c832510666e",
      "text": "哈哈。先不管做不做得到，\n这个点子我就收下了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c3340d59c7b87033fc0a74f571697e0eddc33bcb5e5586eb13eb15fd6a4b48",
      "text": "这样一来全员的恋人设定就都定下来了呢～\n剩下的就是各自负责的区域了～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:389402901ff92e61b9d3971c240f6e658439a18e4c9cbe599447b6793eb0ffe0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我记得我是负责文化区域对吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b43d8a0cb54bddfdea82791e3058f22a8801898a36988f54e6ac4d5a754d05c",
      "text": "是的。然后克里斯先生负责餐厅，\n雨彦先生负责精品服装店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:245144753d04295c6e67d1f669147048af7f61300b8076afc4c9fa93aec65215",
      "text": "多亏了各位的点子，\n感觉能拍出3种非常棒的约会类型呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_c:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93700a5b1fd5dcbc282f8ed4180478aea5a70b29cb0f514e0403efa5f925c1d8",
      "text": "呵呵。为了达成这个目标，\n接下来就进一步敲定约会的内容吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e",
      "text": "一小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c8e3f23dd4ed8ae8f8c64291d1342a47251400e93b7e469e345c658316f2e3f",
      "text": "好，这样就定下来了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee418625d175d67c6ddea664c350b557a38b33f897f240ae98d6ecc0e63fb339",
      "text": "我是“与刚交往不久的同级生，\n进行逛街购物约会”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0597da06675d94766b2226f85c7441786a0ca1588e5426f7733ae7427abad4d1",
      "text": "我是“与彼此互生好感的同事，\n在餐厅里约会”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:396ca5aae091258b181b002174f5b3ffa123519d79e7ee9dd6c018d72f67748a",
      "text": "我是“与下班后的恋人，在精品服装店约会”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee085a7dbe9485d47a0df0aab68937678ef9946391dbb9da9a1e908cdb3e36c0",
      "text": "那么，在最后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d82620dad1c23bf65b880ea57c1a99e352e2c651fc1cdee8a3ced8d875112940",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我们写的台词的确认和润色，就拜托你咯～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f5d500467abdbaf17bde0ac22415310857b91717f0e36a7be384aacce493604",
      "text": "好的，我会全力以赴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82d08c1158cb984887ab893737c3b1b595c97d0d54a650e864c6c6a037b25685",
      "text": "就算不让制作人过目，\n直接用我们写的这些台词不就行了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48e852478cc60a3af51ec37a6bf1af59bbcc13d2952401587fb82e8f5e653e94",
      "text": "是吗～？多借助一些人的力量，\n不是能做出更好的成果吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6447c4b632e9dae6f9e7acb6ceb704a8ef422b1d88b3ef7f695373b6800efd0",
      "text": "因为想通过这次的工作，让我们的粉丝、\n以及粉丝以外的人都心跳加速起来嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e0d80c435d7cb9de840175d61434823ed6f40cbc4ec7e5db99d03d7d3dd68b",
      "text": "我还是挺期待制作人的协助的哦～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648b20dc387c3be7f225b03e4a741e1c0b19cc65f5a03b0e3fcb8df32fdfa119",
      "text": "我也对这类事情很不习惯，\n如果能有你的润色修改，那真是感激不尽……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a458754c65873e36db31eec3f08027b6b1f55ce0750e7ebb2b5cfc87eefb240",
      "text": "明白了。为了将各位的魅力发挥到极致，\n我会认真确认好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000159:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55afcbda754bd57a124d98d5ceb051f5e05f3629ba1dafcb83914b53d0f9b3e7",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n我刚刚在事务所拿到了台本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000170:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea0d3f52043636ccbfd1d31f0acf5eff598026f0639a064c4211684ddeeabe7",
      "text": "台词顺利完成了，\n我本来想当面向您道谢的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28ef3d6a7a83d0cd17cb3e9dcfa09cecf8b954b27bbb10eab9d892928d9c55ed",
      "text": "似乎碰巧跟您错过了呢。\n只能通过电话联系，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000174:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0136de9995a95202d7eacf2e9a66f18af3d4351b59fd6fe437356dec18a6d4e",
      "text": "这个声音是……您现在\n在海边吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000178:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2547f80765023be2980b959ffd2e666c6c7ee983f7ba08bc95d3f87e0a98fe3",
      "text": "是的，正是如此！\n在确认台本的时候，突然就很想去海边看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000180:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74127ecfe30f85002ccb47e0a9b1c568f70e8f55557f302be0fad0b48ca69c7",
      "text": "哎呀，最关键的道谢还没说呢。\n制作人，非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000182:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a52e6dd4af909c8c0521c1c20ae6b34dc4ab79c882e8ca45538e2c249606184",
      "text": "“若能合您心意，我将深感荣幸”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000184:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebcadc6635e8bc1097437dcc2ce89194513e49efac37032a716771abf0220ba1",
      "text": "想要与某人分享自己认为美好的事物。\n读到给我的台词时，我深深地产生了共鸣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd31904224eb3e5a56f684b70d5631ed5e8d4f8c264e8375469d4a684a5132e",
      "text": "我非常期待扮演这一角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000188:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bafd8d90bf7ebb6a325024f46764822b36bbef2379d29e26effaa421b36fe5d7",
      "text": "当天的拍摄，\n我很期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8175c57ec2176d0c3e6b3cfca5e7310ae716a6198bf8f7d7d35bc22ced172478",
      "text": "努力总算是\n没有白费",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_d:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af508c29c9cd7e0f8c3d2644c1e4a32dd1f164dbb2e6845499456ea765c1fdd9",
      "text": "好的，拍摄当天就拜托您了。\n那么，我先挂断了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f9859cc0bbcb1125e8d98276a6bec51cd9c8d0e8530e09589df5a20a4758c5b",
      "text": "今天放晴了真是太好了呢～\n碰头的地方，马上就找到了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:953ddd1ff11482e6d2bebd82a2a35f4725e910e2c54206bfdb2c7a3e4caaea85",
      "text": "呼……第一次约会，难得有点紧张呢。\n……咦，你也是吗？这样啊，跟我一样呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e55de0d2ce29f70bc2579b9adf98b3037476e95aec2d7657a9be3a099bd50df9",
      "text": "对了，那边有一家你可能会喜欢的店哦。\n要不要过去看看～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eefb4fea5a42be382f56d43d8be23dc264523d1236012ffe4f1235d7d645a920",
      "text": "哇，这家杂货店，人气好高啊～\n我们也进去逛逛吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3c62d3bf19797061aceff9f6c3a18154f7955b72b6cc010bf6f4ce12050134a",
      "text": "……呵呵。那个马克杯，你喜欢吗？\n因为，你从刚才开始就一直盯着看嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17917ea988029376245d34d1090f426afc263d51830939b125136f1a65a602f8",
      "text": "那我买个不同颜色的吧～\n……嗯，对啊。在各自的家里用嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000097:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed",
      "text": "拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35833d5c880e29153fc81f92c162e7d665f02029bbd04e5cc30912144a503c1d",
      "text": "想乐先生，听说一遍就过哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eafbc2d0a6a51c0fb1bc2badfd46faab221182adae3bb1cae0d3414c911d4ddc",
      "text": "真的吗？太好啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99ec8d1c699ed5ec8e01cf376c4b4febb8f15ca35388a43f7134585ed2cbc8ee",
      "text": "虽然在拍摄时说了“有点紧张”，\n但其实演的时候挺自然的呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de243cffb53066e9836d848b93d3529c708f827dd08cf03284aaddeef1994baa",
      "text": "这也多亏了●●●●プロデューサー\n帮我确认了台词呢～。谢谢你咯～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83d55c04e7384bdfff5b5a28b50e281b5cfb3a1aa5ffc84f52b985429634ee7e",
      "text": "哪里，如果能帮上忙我就很高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e708a3ce4b4c532585fc22f17cd0ba963bfe4b8e49c45c8d9761629236c491c",
      "text": "（……露出了一副真的很开心的表情呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e57f22f800a2b8a696458b0a3c11ce5629f4171dbb1ce07c8980bc8a4ef4be14",
      "text": "（这样啊。跟●●●●プロデューサー\n待在一起，之所以会觉得很轻松……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f8819ecd9d63909c892fd39591e916361e1dc906d2ff3102427e5920e7701ce",
      "text": "（是因为跟为了自己而勉强察言观色的我不同）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3ec057d90144e084b2e489f8c4eb42daa93e9347d4f1ba7b8a028a33131e818",
      "text": "（制作人，总是能自然而然地\n关心着我们吧～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822385b41b0f9550699f417cd2010523826877934e394498c22323806e3a7bc0",
      "text": "……这么一想，\n制作人还真厉害呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ce3dc820da1b8840c4beffde5a072deda0926c6317592161f9408d939596aa",
      "text": "……？非常感谢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104890c3c49df6ab25a1b2585b5ff747dad9915241510c87774b73bb3840fa14",
      "text": "时尚的餐厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e14e20bc825e45ba7f5c4f2ae86b54cdf20e3b5c88d2789b32e1b81a1835d7d5",
      "text": "……若能合您心意，\n我将深感荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feb2264bc404be09a448104080d02fc9898a9dc9aeb4db40091f693237f0606a",
      "text": "卡——！古论先生，测试拍摄辛苦了。\n那么在正式拍摄之前，先进入短暂休息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb3ce4d080b2e7484b5a3ab39f1535bb0127511df411bf26d6363107f0cfa3a1",
      "text": "克里斯先生，给您水。请用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de54d70d28e2668863e9d58dc5963be32cd422323b73bc959e56932df3a26cb4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n非常感谢……呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3abf0c192fc4926ce97ac9265f9556beeb2a7b452eabaf72ef03a4047a56ed0f",
      "text": "没事吧？\n您看起来很紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45b72d78fd3a052560295fff59f1699afaacede5cae87ab79f2429d2f01c00e6",
      "text": "是的……如果雨彦和想乐在场的话，\n恐怕就不会紧张成这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56577321e714060931a0ae24b3a410342312e0966256666d8bafd10177bcaa75",
      "text": "只有我一个人被摄像机包围着，\n总觉得有些静不下心来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:513d1045f8dcbf15ebf775e5809441f17432a744a93182f7b60c09144a58f2bd",
      "text": "毕竟这类工作几乎还是第一次遇到呢。\n可能让克里斯先生勉强了也说不定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869fa28839efbb2e0c7ee3be412c5359dc49929496c0694dc527b0cf8133941e",
      "text": "不，怎么会……！\n并不是制作人的错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cfceaf47574b491bf9b021ad015f7529153d09aba7c3b99f75794c8c96dd2e5",
      "text": "这是我自己作为偶像的经验不足……\n而且，也是小时候的经历造成的缘故。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1f930f31b79bac471b67370ab897aa51d96e4538441dbb4765bcb9ed3c8855",
      "text": "我在小时候，因为这显眼的外貌，\n一直无法融入周围的人群。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba13c375cabd34005eee083c56b17b2765ccfe5f49147847664f7e6fd83fac3a",
      "text": "和班上任何人都不同的发色和瞳色。\n身高甚至比高年级的学生还要高呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:532086450751bceb1dab53898abf6917322662ca8d69a7f6a8debf7c11a55707",
      "text": "虽说到了现在，多少掌握了一点\n能让自己融入周围的举止……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fa18371ca4b216d9aff1bd8cec8625a2abb2622a229807a9b58d72e99669527",
      "text": "但在此之前，着实吃了不少苦头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd2b4421d9830548a0ab2d5516693afd19b1a0561896574f664196b8a1ffbe3",
      "text": "因此一旦被摄像机包围，\n就总觉得像是被众多的人注视着缺点一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad1f395cf94361c0c0b71e5b845581a073e6d4eed77ac25a466152bc925a79ee",
      "text": "……果然还是让您勉强了呢。\n克里斯先生，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f43c08e3485cace1ea12b5d1b84c81790f73d246ae80b8e0d17ce158358d9314",
      "text": "不过，导演说“那种和尚未表白的对象相处时的\n紧张感表现得很到位！”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09e1c4ac923c399da30113a31c4b05268bf2e736ba85c71dab2c9236c87b9574",
      "text": "现场的各位，反倒觉得克里斯先生的紧张\n呈现出了非常好的效果哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:558fe24fed3f8cd25ea02df7a49bbbb6c3e58ce40f21e2d9c0a5a529470fe3aa",
      "text": "真的吗！那真是太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:479f02fd8e6b44dd3fd99c9af3f1e3c2ebb35094453adbff552acc96c7cb1dfd",
      "text": "但是，一直保持紧张状态的话\n克里斯先生自己也会很担心吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc56398bcfacf72c157922c5eceb38dfb6367f5432547468b0d62e83e284deca",
      "text": "比如说……试着把摄像机想象成\n只要在身边就能让自己安心的人，怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04e386a101e933ceb17497b869eea7e457f3087515e61fcdcd9777cfae32fd80",
      "text": "……\n只要在身边，就能让自己安心的人……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d54a718a6f640d4330ec4ca28b39021748d3b72088b4b7f9fa0c1d1d7dc1e7b4",
      "text": "能很清楚地看到大海吧？第一次来这里时，\n我就想着下一次一定要和您一起过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d34ed83ea13e68ada12ab042c013e7ceefe7c4504b6776b1155109b26e95f3",
      "text": "……因为以前，\n您曾说过“我也喜欢大海”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1d91cd3d4ca538b721ee28ea5153832e76294d258b2194c42c22138ebee7a1",
      "text": "从这里眺望的景色，\n若能合您心意，我将深感荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000048:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3295aa7bbfaf3052bee2ba80d9b7789532ecf05d1be8c8c2f2c21f1885dac2e5",
      "text": "氛围和测试的时候完全不同了呢！\n变得更加迷人了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:575fcb926c63b8fc0494431f094e5f566aba3a693c50e37f029d4fa6b873071e",
      "text": "谢谢您，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:912191c05b7f472faf89f7a1af243107fd93bc5c92c9316cecb591612fafe889",
      "text": "还有……想乐和雨彦。\n我也必须向你们道声谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e01ee98adfc6279daffdecf6cec07dc6af7fd0820e8e6fc41530d80ef176f003",
      "text": "为什么要谢我们呀～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d54be6413a4347ddb8d66d86c1e1628cd7e6eade73d72adbd5d53323029000c6",
      "text": "因为我是把注视着我的摄像机，\n当作是你们去演出的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51cfcc99075430717d196f1412b1a791a12c468d9ab85c6f30a4d67c53fd9fd0",
      "text": "这样一来，不可思议的是摄像机的视线\n竟变得如此令人安心，如此温柔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ce3ac273dd62d5bae03f7c4f4f6ee0dd81d77f87dec8f1777ee8c3340908e45",
      "text": "所以，紧张感也消失了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7228aea3e7dd870e54d863cbc9653fd4f8fbbbdde816679bafb07dd97775288e",
      "text": "没想到我们的存在，还能派上这种用场啊。\n嘛，只要你的心情能放晴就比什么都强了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8b5aff2d7d95dbc47a7b5c16c4e31b5dde1f27c4b3b226ea38ec47edba08958",
      "text": "是的。只要有你们在，哪怕是再大的风浪\n我也能够跨越过去……我切实体会到了这一点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5585a539771c3536ac734a4db20e6ce13399914a14aa090cce242b1fdf0d443",
      "text": "Legenders的各位，辛苦了！\n请移动到下一个拍摄地点——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b09ce59082f1c563b209bc2f814cc000160a9bbb28a12c719f92f1f94d1ceb9",
      "text": "好～的。……那么，\n把这份自信也活用到接下来的环节去吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_h:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08a3a8355fdd14f788aeb0baef6ab0ed64c9422fa258d1d39c41d5c53f46997",
      "text": "下面是要挑选想让恋人穿上的衣服对吧。\n我很期待古论会挑选什么样的衣服哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e78be7d0a593840839ba148e90b5095ecd1bdfabac8b4f95922c4f00562442",
      "text": "要选什么样的衣服好呢～……\n哎呀，克里斯先生。已经决定好了～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:268f0b0058058a94ae7cf88050e83bd94715a555ed4f61a9291fec254bc0e166",
      "text": "哎，哇啊～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a328b424b6462ec8584bd11c339fb33906cdf139949c969b04e9b4ae5233577b",
      "text": "这个可真是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1addbc2d65b3c55ec462c5cb0e2cf9dbf9ef691381aa4ef391dccf9417b246ef",
      "text": "非常棒的搭配呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0746dec24ee47b272e98b661399950226494a2f72fece580adf9477d0c96e0",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖。\n我参考了身边女性的装束，试着挑选了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c4ce70b3ca0825158f9b6b769b2ea148f9f3e97a13e0d2bf3b201f949ae887",
      "text": "你这家伙，对自己平时的穿搭看似毫不在意，\n一挑起女装来品味完全大变样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfc7f2bca1e730af8eef04247177e2de500ed70932889a7ecf1bd45d6a3257b7",
      "text": "嗯，超有品味的呢～\n话说回来，身边的女性是指谁啊～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f01596bce4a9fd1caa8901ba115848293238cb60bc4599295e70b2f8c24d4e41",
      "text": "是母亲和妹妹。因为有时也会陪她们去买东西，\n这次应该是活用了从她们那里学到的知识吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f18cfd5398845831aa9430caf420436abc46078ab46b2571a27e8e9ecd45a4",
      "text": "诶～。既然学习能有这么大的改变，\n对自己平时的时尚也多抱点兴趣不就好了嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c484b74a16c25c5649f3f890f3cd0d4524f026ac94037e114f0a7d75aa81e5b",
      "text": "呵呵……是啊。以此项工作为契机，\n我也许稍微变得积极一些了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5824678ae6c746fe645e4f8298fc00f772998f4dc1b249b8841496e7df218421",
      "text": "这下子，排在古论后面登场可让人有点犯怵啊。\n好，北村，我有个提议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_i:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2380f2a40bb874cd74ea19cbea7abeaadb1c370533f83757359e9bd2ea4448e",
      "text": "两个人同时展示怎么样？\n挑好了就叫我一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aef1a65ab4bcb9851f14623d396b26a870c88cecac6cefe52fc459a104484af6",
      "text": "哟。……什么啊，我也才刚到而已。比起这个，\n突发的工作能顺利解决真是太好了。辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:158ffe130de752085cce91784c6e41bb5a439eeae40cef3786a2dfc668262abd",
      "text": "啊啊，距离预约的餐厅还有点时间呢。\n要不要找个地方歇会儿？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:629ef3b987f3e46d41506724f2e0a72466b249015d05f4d698ae3ac2119f7537",
      "text": "……想让我在那家店帮你挑衣服？\n好啊，我来给你挑一套最棒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe273e30207feec502f526cbcf500ad527bb3ee91a81897273aeefe253873089",
      "text": "嗯？换好衣服了吗……\n啊啊，果然不出所料很适合你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1091f2425012b2698594965813b57d895e9f50594f6ccfb67344acb6f4c32ac7",
      "text": "为什么选这件衣服？那是因为……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922464b31a156651d806cf2f7bd221d2d24bd305bb0d7ee012370538bcccca6e",
      "text": "脑海里浮现出了穿着这件衣服的你，和我一起\n在晚餐后欣赏灯光秀的画面啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000091:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "数小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19934807a36ffb1446e88e824bafe614f2030aa12d090e5d5c393a981028e5ad",
      "text": "这就是雨彦先生想让恋人穿的衣服啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b6811b3c8e30625bf9287baea96e62567c5112fd524802acd0f064661f8129",
      "text": "您喜欢这种穿着打扮的女性吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b62373bcb0ecfd382c903a14759bdaa9105b83ef7f8271268ad9caf39d396921",
      "text": "不啊？不是喜欢不喜欢的问题，正如台词里说的那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ade27fb580ecee067d7acbb8d18093b3f3edc0fad1396a245f9d308e43227b3",
      "text": "我觉得这个衣领和袖口上亮晶晶的部分，\n跟彩灯装饰很像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e84273ca1c0f5903a1f2837cb5951e4cc2cb3f4f95d4f0cbf867628e7faee0d7",
      "text": "原来如此，确实……穿着这件衣服的女性，\n即便是在深海中也会是惹人注目的身姿吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbbdf028e67721ecf0e31b7bdf1ca35147043c14c510bf5749de948ce9b10fe6",
      "text": "这么一想，在我眼里也留下了极其良好的印象！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_j:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a1a004a3b798436d2ad6b92ff93a6faeb12f7b150daf4e583cab280782b8c0b",
      "text": "那个啊，克里斯先生。\n我们大概是被他糊弄过去了哦～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57d8ad2bdecb90bb5f48b827648e78834d9acb7e6128f7afa7c4b0033352b103",
      "text": "花园区域",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b37c2ad20877ab45025d6951d34f7e4f509dbc3e36c1bc287569aecbefacc02a",
      "text": "极目远眺处，百闻不如一见时，夜色正迷离……\n这里的景色，难怪是负责人的首选推荐呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99e4c053be72836543d419bf886693f4a5135ffde380072a2044ffb030a54efc",
      "text": "是啊，宛如萤火鱿被冲上海滩一般。\n虽说正值冬日，却是一副难得的胜景呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6279f610ea00aadc919e93aa1db991a127557067bbba89b98181c4e2c668898d",
      "text": "非常浪漫，\n和合作绑定的歌曲也极为相配呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:377b4e4a184c22f10e8d6c0133ee255dcbef953244ac111eedcd2fd04f10dd5c",
      "text": "嗯。要是能以我们现在拍摄的CM为契机，\n让更多的人欣赏到这片景色就好了～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b7ce6e9506730ce38b40b7feced0aca3ae9244345306424758b7e08d63d344",
      "text": "是的！为了能让广大的人们\n了解这份美丽，一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cb019f3b7a97c81a2138a82a849aaf7f667155a21a665b7484b19c3bdeb06bc",
      "text": "啊……好像在叫我们了。\nLegenders，准备好了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20248932405e3511393ea8d1231c7ccf3aa9d21fe8c13117c3be8f288889f82f",
      "text": "那么我们要去进行最后的拍摄了哦，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc146232ee8a11ad80a3695f403354cc8ee50ab8f78be046413a452ff0ecbfc5",
      "text": "就在那里满怀期待地等我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:573feeda0650cde8c8e8ca2d0b066fc78dfbcf1cd891c090e14ae0f16e4711cf",
      "text": "保证给你展现出一个让你觉得\n拜托我们算是拜托对了的帅气收尾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000123:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39c8bcce335ab6aa65dd0369148ef53655612230afa7538a3d977ed57f3af276",
      "text": "从今天开始就要播放\nLegenders的CM了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dbf95f207ceb97131f1bee4c57e883e5febd4b6a63fde5b01ec971e2b05709c",
      "text": "之前告知的播放时间\n马上就要到了，\n我正在和家人一起看电视。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f7a45897a4edebf15f557091adc90c5eb6b26ceb6a2c205df6ddc21ba80f77c",
      "text": "差不多到时间了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000137:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0478e3436d07d9f1d58a6e170c2004928b2e1f90518d17faf4a14c797522444a",
      "text": "我也把电视打开了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000143:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d308837f3a324a0b8605acf72a05cdb0b9b11c9f0e932671baf7e0cc1833ab0",
      "text": "播出了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000143:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:657a8dde05297a8d438c20e66d6f9afa0e0eb7a266af9cb22c6fa96a45c4bb65",
      "text": "各位，播出了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfa969652171a324cc6dd8dec8e17f358f160405eba61f514894ab3aa669171",
      "text": "约会视频的一部分\n也播出了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c29fa9f677c0cab9757216b455b89f1d040f74f24823349c137257eaa94c2210",
      "text": "虽说完成品之前已经\n看过了，但在家里的\n电视上看感觉又不一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000150:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed7b2f55fc78ffdbd523755d6a4fadd5285ca1b01a77ce76a51b53754d94eee8",
      "text": "是这样呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000150:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a6b4a892868dd88f6c162672d622ef0c12d8451320b223b5ef529396f357dea",
      "text": "是这样呢。希望接下来\n能被更多的人\n看到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:775540d8106adb38467c21ad7f039bd1744204a4210b687def9ffd459a7d9a93",
      "text": "别有一番风味",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000151:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f55c6b99b7ba2e7d81e437f5a5f3d27b29c1c86d02995a3b9a5a034da7a2fc52",
      "text": "在电视上看\n别有一番风味呢。\n两种都非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000154:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08253c9c2ad5a7d54908a779421bdce819fc90b0731dccddfbb473c10fb31d27",
      "text": "刚好回家的哥哥\n把CM看个正着啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000156:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be03dc579e76b45713e92f103cbeb9a5a3347c7b2545141d805604db7446e33a",
      "text": "刚才没回消息\n原来是因为这个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000158:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851e6f5d52d710c7c5eb3ec38b675036d946743a49df48e9d27b090662c2ceb0",
      "text": "虽说是碰巧，\n但能一起看\n真是太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000160:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d80c2991a7dccee06b57e6ed5c0a804fd71fc1c6cdae80b909abfbc8a4d79dd1",
      "text": "说好倒也\n算是挺好的吧，\n不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000162:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5498e5ab42f894d96072cdd92e20c45a234e42927effda199f288d7e061405",
      "text": "说是有一堆想要\n发表的意见～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000164:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad4e0ce0692fd1b381c76346f5fe64db5386f54b4160935f85d9babb3a0d6df7",
      "text": "唠叨个没完没了，\n我去听他说了～大家的\n感想我等会儿再看哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ddd9df2b9090ba67022141ad1c4bac3207337f86a05c57c938c022e8b73fcf",
      "text": "说起来，想乐的哥哥\n是在广告代理公司上班呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10004_01:1_3_10004_01_k:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9138b7e031caea26007bb56fac3ac197bbf87f6ee3763c8a4b66d6b35686aea3",
      "text": "北村。下次碰面的时候，\n记得跟我讲讲\n都有什么意见啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
